Sound stage 3 (spescodec=3): a stream into the codec, amplifiers off.

As HackiOS redwood_sound.c sound=2 over APR on spes's path: SID 0x1C1 passes addresses through
(SpesModem smmu_identity, now exported), a 64 KB tone buffer from the pool below 4 GiB is mapped
by ASM (msw 1), the codec DMA port RX_CDC_DMA_RX_1 0xb032 configured and started, an ADM device
path and an ASM stream run a 1 kHz tone for 3 s, with Topaz's SoundWire data ports and the
WCD937x AUX PA on; the DSP's write-done events are counted, then everything is closed.

